        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Rectangular piece, full loom width.  Left, a vignette, framed in pink, yellow and blue flowers, showing a garden setting in which are represented full-length portraits of Napoleon III, the Empress Eugénie and their son Eugène Louis Jean Joseph.  Right, enclosed in a ring of flowers, the arms of Napoleon: on an armine ground, under an imperial crown, a golden eagle on blue shield; crossed golden scepters behind; below, badge of the Legion of Honor; the whole enclosed between curved laurel branches.  Cotton browned.  Condition good."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/4c48183c-eeff-3b00-a7e0-ee96f5c0c3f6> ;
